ProjectM TV: consume evaluated built-in waveform controls

Read per-frame mode/dots/thickness/additive flags without overwriting defaults.
Recreate waveform math on mode changes; reuse one evaluated geometry stream for
authored/native targets. Preserve truncation and signed remainder over the 16
projectM modes; unrepresentable/nonfinite modes draw nothing.

Compatibility reference: MilkDrop3 code/vis_milk2/milkdropfs.cpp, evaluated
var_pf_wave_mode (2769), additive (2717), thick/dots (3259/3275/3282).
Independent local repair; no MilkDrop3 implementation copied.
